],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, February to March and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years. In 2025 on the middle, April to May ran 180% of normal and November to December just 39%, and so far in 2026 January to February came in at 32%. Every grid had its driest year in 1963, down to 58% of normal on grid 19363.</p>"}
